  "description": "PDF reader for VellumPdf: opens an existing signed PDF (classic cross-reference tables, unencrypted) and exposes its catalog and signatures, on a bounds-checked lexer and object parser (ISO 32000-2 §7.2–7.5). BCL-only; zero runtime dependencies. The foundation for PAdES long-term validation and a growing general reader; cross-reference streams, object streams, and encryption are not supported yet.",
